<title>NORWAY: Oslo bourse to extend trading time by one hour.</title>
<headline>Oslo bourse to extend trading time by one hour.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Oslo Bourse said on Monday it will extend trading hours by one hour per day from March 3, 1997.</p>
<p>The bourse will open at 10 a.m. local time and close at 5 p.m. It currently closes at 4 p.m.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bourse said the new opening times will be for a trial period and will be evaluated some time at the end of 1997.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
